     <td colspan="10"><para unique="1261420">NOTES:</para>
      <para unique="1261421">F	Means finite floating-point value.</para>
      <para unique="1261422">*	Indicates floating-point invalid-operation (#IA) exception.</para>
      <para unique="1261423">**	Indicates floating-point zero-divide (#Z) exception.</para>
      </td>
